I have a different opinion on that point; Mjollnir is a weapon that
you may use to your advantage until you start the "late game" phase.
Valkyries advance levels quickly any you get enough slots to enhance
two (or even three) weapons to Expert in the "early game" phase. If
you have the chance to melee with Mjollnir you have a chance that you
destroy the attacker's wand. (Though, I also perfer the pet approach.
And Excalibur is advantageous for its searching capability and better
in the late game.) If you would have had gauntlets of power throwing
Mjollnir might have been an option _in this specific case_, as a very
effective substitute for the daggers you were lacking; it is a ranged
attack and might destroy the attacker's wands.

